  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0035, merged in PR #4181): stable_id carries the full scope chain plus name, which disambiguates same-base-name sibling methods — the root cause of the 506 out-of-span src attributions. Waits on the hash-input/endpoint-resolution fix implementing the new contract."  # 8825
